{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40735","headline":"龙州韦郎中先梦六赤後因打叶子以诗上 · 李洞","name":"龙州韦郎中先梦六赤後因打叶子以诗上","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"红蜡香烟扑画楹，梅花落尽庾楼清。\n光辉圆魄衔山冷，彩镂方牙着腕轻。\n宝帖牵来狮子镇，金盆引出凤凰倾。\n微黄喜兆庄周梦，六赤重新掷印成。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李洞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40735.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40735","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}